ript — file page 75, lines 19-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 75, lines 19-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 76, lines 11-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 76, lines 11-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 77, lines 35-43","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 77, lines 35-43"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 78, lines 13-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 78, lines 13-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 78, lines 53-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 78, lines 53-11"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 79, lines 53-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 79, lines 53-11"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 8, lines 55-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 8, lines 55-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 80, lines 23-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 80, lines 23-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 80, lines 31-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 80, lines 31-31"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 9, lines 29-31","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 9, lines 29-31"}]}],"caption":"FCC v. Consumers' Research","case_history":[{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T20:06:14.680045Z","explanation":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T20:06:14.686460Z","explanation":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T20:06:14.708193Z","explanation":"An official oral-argument transcript was verified.","status":"argued"},{"changed_at":"2026-08-29T23:55:45.916335Z","explanation":"An official Court opinion was verified.","status":"decided"}],"case_status":"decided","dek":"Consumers' Research argues the FCC exceeds its power by setting fees without clear limits. The FCC claims Congress authorized these charges.","dek_sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 106, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 106, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 112, lines 11-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 112, lines 11-53"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 133, lines 33-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 133, lines 33-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 177, lines 55-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 177, lines 55-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 68, lines 51-19","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 68, lines 51-19"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 70, lines 15-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 70, lines 15-25"}],"maturity":"post_opinion","official_detail_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcript/2024","official_disposition_urls":["https://www.supremecourt.gov/opinions/24pdf/606us2r64_8nj9.pdf"],"official_docket_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/docket/docketfiles/html/public/24-354.html","primary_docket":"24-354","revisions":[{"correction_note":"Rewritten to the concise citizen-facing editorial standard.","created_at":"2026-08-30T15:41:20.217737Z","maturity":"post_opinion","revision_number":1}],"schema_version":"1.0","sections":[{"heading":"What this case is about","paragraphs":["The dispute centers on the FCC's power to set fees for the universal service fund. Consumers' Research claims this power is too broad. The FCC argues Congress gave it clear authority."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 106, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 106, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 112, lines 11-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 112, lines 11-53"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 133, lines 33-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 133, lines 33-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 177, lines 55-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 177, lines 55-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 68, lines 51-19","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 68, lines 51-19"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 70, lines 15-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 70, lines 15-25"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on March 26, 2025."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 146, lines 13-33","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 146, lines 13-33"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 11-23","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 11-23"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 69, lines 55-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 69, lines 55-13"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["The FCC wants the Court to uphold its fee-setting power. It argues Congress gave it clear authority to manage the fund.","Consumers' Research wants the Court to strike down the fees. It argues the FCC lacks specific limits on how much it can collect."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 106, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 106, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 112, lines 11-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 112, lines 11-53"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 133, lines 33-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 133, lines 33-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 177, lines 55-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 177, lines 55-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 68, lines 51-19","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 68, lines 51-19"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 70, lines 15-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 70, lines 15-25"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["The FCC argues Section 254 provides a clear policy goal. It claims this goal limits its discretion to set reasonable charges.","Consumers' Research argues the law lacks specific monetary limits. It claims this allows the FCC to impose taxes without representation."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 106, lines 23-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 106, lines 23-9"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 112, lines 11-53","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 112, lines 11-53"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 133, lines 33-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 133, lines 33-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 177, lines 55-17","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 177, lines 55-17"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 25-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2024/24-354_3e07.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 25-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file pa